<h1>The Dangers of Wolpertingers</h1>
</div>
<div id="content">
<div id="preamble">
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Don&#8217;t worry about gumberoos or splintercats.
Something far more fearsome plagues the days, nights, and inbetweens.
Wolpertingers.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="_origins">Origins</h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Wolpertingers are <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wolpertinger">ravenous beasts</a>.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph left text-center">
<p><span class="image"><a class="image" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wolpertinger.jpg"><img src="wolpertinger.jpg" alt="Wolpertinger" width="100"></a></span>
They may look cute and cuddly, but don&#8217;t be fooled.</p>
